{
  "case_id": "2019-18-1171",
  "document_hash": "7163a04b2b3940a60b0b6b61d38092dae8bec824476ca0ee1efb56ca69e9e0b1",
  "records": [
    {
      "attribution": "Comcast Corporation",
      "case_id": "2019-18-1171",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "7163a04b2b3940a60b0b6b61d38092dae8bec824476ca0ee1efb56ca69e9e0b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-7163a04b2b39-0000-0002",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 5,
        "start": 5
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Second, in 1991, Congress amended Title VII to provide for a motivating factor standard but did not amend Section 1981 to provide the same, even though it amended Section 1981 in other respects at the same time."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
      "case_id": "2019-18-1171",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "7163a04b2b3940a60b0b6b61d38092dae8bec824476ca0ee1efb56ca69e9e0b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-7163a04b2b39-0001-0000",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 24,
        "start": 24
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE SOTOMAYOR: -- why is that not\nactionable?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Alito",
      "case_id": "2019-18-1171",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "7163a04b2b3940a60b0b6b61d38092dae8bec824476ca0ee1efb56ca69e9e0b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-7163a04b2b39-0001-0005",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 37,
        "start": 37
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE ALITO: At the end of the day\n-- at the end of the day, what is the burden of\npersuasion in this case, in a case like this?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
      "case_id": "2019-18-1171",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "7163a04b2b3940a60b0b6b61d38092dae8bec824476ca0ee1efb56ca69e9e0b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-7163a04b2b39-0001-0004",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 38,
        "start": 38
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE KAGAN: But -- but burden of\npersuasion as to what issue?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
      "case_id": "2019-18-1171",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "7163a04b2b3940a60b0b6b61d38092dae8bec824476ca0ee1efb56ca69e9e0b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-7163a04b2b39-0001-0003",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 44,
        "start": 44
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE BREYER: Well, then why on\nthose same facts can't you put your bottom line,\nand, therefore, but-for the racial\ndiscrimination? What's the difference?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
      "case_id": "2019-18-1171",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "7163a04b2b3940a60b0b6b61d38092dae8bec824476ca0ee1efb56ca69e9e0b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-7163a04b2b39-0002-0000",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 46,
        "start": 46
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Wouldn't the very hypothetical you've given us satisfy the but-for test?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
      "case_id": "2019-18-1171",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "7163a04b2b3940a60b0b6b61d38092dae8bec824476ca0ee1efb56ca69e9e0b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-7163a04b2b39-0002-0002",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 49,
        "start": 49
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "All right, but on that, wouldn't it be unusual for us to say that the test for the pleading stage is motivating factor, but the test at the trial or at summary judgment is but-for?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Alito",
      "case_id": "2019-18-1171",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "7163a04b2b3940a60b0b6b61d38092dae8bec824476ca0ee1efb56ca69e9e0b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-7163a04b2b39-0002-0004",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 51,
        "start": 51
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "What if the complaint alleges this was not the but-for cause of the adverse action against me, but it was a motivating factor? Would that be sufficient to go forward?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
      "case_id": "2019-18-1171",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "7163a04b2b3940a60b0b6b61d38092dae8bec824476ca0ee1efb56ca69e9e0b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-7163a04b2b39-0002-0005",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 54,
        "start": 54
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Would --would you agree the Ninth Circuit was wrong, though?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
      "case_id": "2019-18-1171",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "7163a04b2b3940a60b0b6b61d38092dae8bec824476ca0ee1efb56ca69e9e0b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-7163a04b2b39-0002-0006",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 58,
        "start": 58
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "But do you think you do win or not?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
      "case_id": "2019-18-1171",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "7163a04b2b3940a60b0b6b61d38092dae8bec824476ca0ee1efb56ca69e9e0b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-7163a04b2b39-0002-0007",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 59,
        "start": 59
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "focus is on the availability of the burden-shifting mechanism, right?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
      "case_id": "2019-18-1171",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "7163a04b2b3940a60b0b6b61d38092dae8bec824476ca0ee1efb56ca69e9e0b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-7163a04b2b39-0002-0008",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 60,
        "start": 60
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "but-for -- was the reason for the denial of a contract?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Heritage Reporting Corporation",
      "case_id": "2019-18-1171",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "7163a04b2b3940a60b0b6b61d38092dae8bec824476ca0ee1efb56ca69e9e0b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-7163a04b2b39-0003-0000",
      "kind": "allegation",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 68,
        "start": 68
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "And the second amended complaint alleges many facts that would support plausibly that race was the motivating factor in denying contracts."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
      "case_id": "2019-18-1171",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "7163a04b2b3940a60b0b6b61d38092dae8bec824476ca0ee1efb56ca69e9e0b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-7163a04b2b39-0003-0001",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 68,
        "start": 68
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "But also enough to allege that the NAACP and the National Urban League and the other individuals were in on the conspiracy?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Heritage Reporting Corporation",
      "case_id": "2019-18-1171",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "7163a04b2b3940a60b0b6b61d38092dae8bec824476ca0ee1efb56ca69e9e0b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-7163a04b2b39-0003-0003",
      "kind": "allegation",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 70,
        "start": 70
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "the current complaint continues to allege that white-owned media and Comcast in particular works hand in glove with the federal government to execute this racist conspiracy."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2019-18-1171",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "7163a04b2b3940a60b0b6b61d38092dae8bec824476ca0ee1efb56ca69e9e0b1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-7163a04b2b39-0003-0004",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 73,
        "start": 73
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "(Whereupon, at 11:06 a.m., the case was submitted.)"
    },
